15
01:06:25,714 --> 01:06:31,714
The Alpinist is a 2021 American documentary film directed by Peter Mortimer and Nick Rosen about Marc-André
Leclerc, a free-spirited and little-known 23-year-old Canadian rock climber, ice climber, and alpinist.

16
01:10:51,428 --> 01:10:57,428
From 2015 to 2016, a film crew followed Leclerc as he solo climbed some of the
most difficult and dangerous alpine climbing routes in the world.

17
01:15:17,142 --> 01:15:23,142
The film was produced by Sender Films and Red Bull Media House, and
distributed by Universal Pictures and Roadside Attractions.

18
01:19:42,857 --> 01:19:48,857
The film was given a limited release on September
10, 2021, in the United States.

19
01:24:08,571 --> 01:24:14,571
It received generally positive reviews from film
critics and from the climbing media.

20
01:28:34,285 --> 01:28:40,285
The film explores themes of mountain, biography, climbing,
patagonia, argentina, mountain climbing.
